i>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">^</mo></mover></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> must be\nbefore the plug-in understates the standard deviation by ten per\ncent.</p>","file":"ch32-linear-mixed-models/06-bayes.html"}